{"summary":"铸钟黄土是古代铸造大钟时使用的黄土，性味不详，主要用治突发心痛、中恶气等急症，常以温酒送服一钱。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《拾遗》）","translation":"出自《本草拾遗》。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"卒心痛，疰忤恶气，温酒服一钱（藏器）。","translation":"治疗突发的心痛，以及因疰忤恶气引起的疾病，用温酒送服一钱。"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E5%9C%9F%E9%83%A8#鑄鐘黃土","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:20.994Z"}